  <h1>The journalists behind the reporting.</h1>
  <p>America’s News Today is published by Scott Coleman and edited by Catherine Palmer. The senior editorial staff are listed below.</p></div></div></header><section class="ros"><div class="w">
  <div class="ros-h">
    <div>
      <div class="ros-eye"><i></i><span>Who we are</span></div>
      <div class="ros-t">The Masthead</div>
    </div>
    <div class="ros-c">Four editors · Four cities</div>
  </div>
  <div class="ros-l">
    <a href="#p1" class="rr"><div class="rr-n">01</div><div class="rr-nm">Catherine Palmer</div><div class="rr-rl">Editor-in-Chief</div><div class="rr-lc">Indianapolis</div></a>
    <a href="#p2" class="rr"><div class="rr-n">02</div><div class="rr-nm">Nicholas Griffin</div><div class="rr-rl">Managing Editor</div><div class="rr-lc">Tampa</div></a>
    <a href="#p3" class="rr"><div class="rr-n">03</div><div class="rr-nm">Denise Chapman</div><div class="rr-rl">Business Editor</div><div class="rr-lc">Grand Rapids</div></a>
