    <p>If you have original reporting that fits one of our desks, send a short pitch describing what you have, who you have talked to, and what documents you hold.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="jn-r"><a href="mailto:editorial@americasnewstoday.org" class="jn-cta">Pitch the newsroom →</a></div></div></div></section>`;
